<title>KAZAKHSTAN: Kazakh tenge falls to 75.4300 to dlr.</title>
<headline>Kazakh tenge falls to 75.4300 to dlr.</headline>
<dateline>ALMATY 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The tenge closed at 75.4300 per dollar on the Kazakhstan Currency Exchange on Tuesday after 75.1900 on Monday.</p>
<p> TENGE PER DOLLAR	     May 6		   May 5</p>
<p> High			     75.4650		 75.2000</p>
